  "content": "\n\n<p>提供多種實用且有趣的飾品，全部均可透過合成獲得。<br><br>它們擁有設定檔，可根據您的需求進行調整。</p>\n<p>我的其他專案：<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/bountifulbaubles-reforked\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">bountifulbaubles-reforked</a> &nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/trinkets-and-baubles-reforked\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">trinkets-and-baubles-reforked</a> &nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/exporbrecall\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">exporbrecall</a> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/bossspawner\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">bossspawner</a> &nbsp;<a style=\"background-color:rgb(13, 13, 13);font-family:Lato, &amp;#x27\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/step-height\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">step-height</a> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/baublesreforked\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">baublesreforked</a>&nbsp; <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/forsaken-items\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">forsaken-items</a><br><br>✅ 功能：為遊戲添加多款全新飾品，讓您的冒險更加有趣</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_1ad72e55-4a93-4715-8603-61278e5889a5.png\"></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/trinkets-and-baubles\" rel=\"nofollow\">本模組為「Trinkets and Baubles」的 1.21.1 版本，原始模組為：Trinkets and Baubles - Minecraft Mods - CurseForge</a></p>",
